BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:hk_tour_reg@hkust-exchange
DTSTAMP:20260813T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260813
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260814
SUMMARY:HK Day Tour - Registration Deadline
DESCRIPTION:Register for the Hong Kong Day Tour via the MyStudyAbroad syste
 m. Quotas are limited and allocated by a random ballot after the deadline 
 - no late registration. Results & payment details are announced by email b
 y 17 Aug\; payment is due by 20 Aug. Meals are provided during the tour (l
 imited dietary accommodation). School of Business & Management students ar
 e recommended to choose Tour (1).
LOCATION:MyStudyAbroad system
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:online_reg@hkust-exchange
DTSTAMP:20260813T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260814
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260815
SUMMARY:Online Registration Deadline (before arrival)
DESCRIPTION:Complete BEFORE your arrival at HKUST: (1) Online Registration 
 Form\; (2) Upload your travel document / student e-Visa\; (3) Upload a pas
 sport-style photo on a white background\; (4) Complete the Assumption of R
 isk & Release Form. SBM students: wait for instructions from your School. 
 Not applicable to HKUST Guangzhou campus students.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:hk_tour_pay@hkust-exchange
DTSTAMP:20260813T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260820
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260821
SUMMARY:HK Day Tour - Payment Deadline
DESCRIPTION:If successful in the ballot\, settle your payment by 20 Aug to 
 secure your seat. Check your email regularly.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:free_essentials@hkust-exchange
DTSTAMP:20260813T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Asia/Hong_Kong:20260825T140000
DTEND;TZID=Asia/Hong_Kong:20260825T170000
SUMMARY:Free Essentials Pickup - "Stop! Don't Shop! Adopt!"
DESCRIPTION:Pick up FREE beddings\, kitchenware and electronics for your ne
 w hall - don't buy what you can adopt! Weekday only. Full schedule: 20-24 
 Aug beddings 2-5pm\; 25-26 Aug all items 2-5pm\; 27 Aug-1 Sep 12-5pm. Loca
 tion: Living Lab Hub (opposite Passione Cafe).
LOCATION:Living Lab Hub (opposite Passione Cafe)
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:hall_checkin@hkust-exchange
DTSTAMP:20260813T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Asia/Hong_Kong:20260827T100000
DTEND;TZID=Asia/Hong_Kong:20260827T103000
SUMMARY:Hall Check-in Opens (earliest)
DESCRIPTION:Earliest check-in to HKUST student housing is 10:00am\, 27 Aug 
 - no early check-in can be arranged. Hall allocation results are emailed t
 o your HKUST account from SHRLO around one week before the earliest check-
 in date. Undergraduate exchange students are guaranteed and expected to st
 ay in university housing.
LOCATION:HKUST Student Housing
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:welcome_lounge_1@hkust-exchange
DTSTAMP:20260813T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Asia/Hong_Kong:20260827T140000
DTEND;TZID=Asia/Hong_Kong:20260827T170000
SUMMARY:Welcome Lounge (Day 1) + Campus Tour sign-up
DESCRIPTION:At the Welcome Lounge (Tsang Shiu Tim Art Hall) collect your we
 lcome package - insurance certificate\, Non-local Student Pocket Guide\, I
 nternational SOS Information Sheet\, International SOS Membership Card\, E
 mergency Card\, and your Welcome Reception entry pass - plus a welcome gif
 t. Sign up for a campus tour\, meet your HKUST Exchange Buddies\, and ask 
 any questions. Service hours: 27 Aug 14:00-17:00\; 28 Aug 09:30-11:30.
LOCATION:Tsang Shiu Tim Art Hall
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:student_card@hkust-exchange
DTSTAMP:20260813T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Asia/Hong_Kong:20260827T140000
DTEND;TZID=Asia/Hong_Kong:20260827T170000
SUMMARY:Collect Student Card (Day 1)
DESCRIPTION:Bring your travel document (Passport\, EEP\, or HKID) and your 
 landing slip. Your card is ready the next working day AFTER you submit ALL
  registration documents (including the landing slip). Pick-up: 27 Aug 14:0
 0-17:00 & 28 Aug 10:00-12:00 / 14:00-16:00 at LT-L\, G/F\, Cheng Yu Tung B
 uilding\; from 1 Sep at the Academic Registry Office during office hours. 
 Collection deadline: 11 Sep.
LOCATION:LT-L\, G/F\, Cheng Yu Tung Building
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:welcome_lounge_2@hkust-exchange
DTSTAMP:20260813T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Asia/Hong_Kong:20260828T093000
DTEND;TZID=Asia/Hong_Kong:20260828T113000
SUMMARY:Welcome Lounge (Day 2)
DESCRIPTION:At the Welcome Lounge (Tsang Shiu Tim Art Hall) collect your we
 lcome package - insurance certificate\, Non-local Student Pocket Guide\, I
 nternational SOS Information Sheet\, International SOS Membership Card\, E
 mergency Card\, and your Welcome Reception entry pass - plus a welcome gif
 t. Sign up for a campus tour\, meet your HKUST Exchange Buddies\, and ask 
 any questions. Service hours: 27 Aug 14:00-17:00\; 28 Aug 09:30-11:30.
LOCATION:Tsang Shiu Tim Art Hall
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:orientation@hkust-exchange
DTSTAMP:20260813T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Asia/Hong_Kong:20260828T130000
DTEND;TZID=Asia/Hong_Kong:20260828T145000
SUMMARY:Orientation Session (MANDATORY)
DESCRIPTION:Mandatory orientation session for all incoming exchange student
 s. Shaw Auditorium\, 13:00-14:50.
LOCATION:Shaw Auditorium
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:academic_induction@hkust-exchange
DTSTAMP:20260813T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Asia/Hong_Kong:20260828T150000
DTEND;TZID=Asia/Hong_Kong:20260828T170000
SUMMARY:Academic Induction Session (your School only)
DESCRIPTION:Attend the Academic Induction of your admitted School ONLY (3:0
 0-5:00pm): School of Science (SSCI) to Lecture Theatre E · School of Engin
 eering (SENG) to Lecture Theatre A · School of Business & Management (SBM)
  to Lecture Theatre B · School of Humanities & Social Science (SHSS) to Le
 cture Theatre K.
LOCATION:Cheng Yu Tung Building lecture theatres
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ikea_shuttle@hkust-exchange
DTSTAMP:20260813T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Asia/Hong_Kong:20260828T170000
DTEND;TZID=Asia/Hong_Kong:20260828T200000
SUMMARY:IKEA Shuttle Bus
DESCRIPTION:Shuttle bus to IKEA to grab essentials and beddings. Gather at 
 the Welcome Lounge\; return route IKEA to Jockey Club Hall to HKUST. 28 Au
 g 17:00-20:00.
LOCATION:Gather at Welcome Lounge (Tsang Shiu Tim Art Hall)
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:wellbeing@hkust-exchange
DTSTAMP:20260813T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Asia/Hong_Kong:20260831T104500
DTEND;TZID=Asia/Hong_Kong:20260831T120000
SUMMARY:Non-academic Opportunities & Your Wellbeing
DESCRIPTION:Learn about sports and other non-academic opportunities and wel
 lbeing support at HKUST. Shaw Auditorium\, 31 Aug 10:45-12:00.
LOCATION:Shaw Auditorium
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:welcome_reception@hkust-exchange
DTSTAMP:20260813T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Asia/Hong_Kong:20260831T121000
DTEND;TZID=Asia/Hong_Kong:20260831T134500
SUMMARY:Welcome Reception
DESCRIPTION:Sip\, snack and socialize. Bring your Welcome Reception entry p
 ass (collected at the Welcome Lounge). China Garden\, 31 Aug 12:10-13:45.
LOCATION:China Garden
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:landing_slip@hkust-exchange
DTSTAMP:20260813T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260911
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260912
SUMMARY:Landing Slip Upload & Student Card Collection Deadline
DESCRIPTION:By 11 Sep\, upload your student landing slip (issued by the Imm
 igration Officer when you enter Hong Kong)\, if applicable. This is also t
 he deadline to collect your student card.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:snap_challenge@hkust-exchange
DTSTAMP:20260813T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260925
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260926
SUMMARY:Exchange Snap Challenge - Submission Deadline
DESCRIPTION:Create a short video on one of these themes - travel vlog-style
  reel of your orientation\, "Day in the Life at HKUST"\, "Hidden gems on c
 ampus"\, "Hong Kong with HKUST"\, or "Found my squad at HKUST". Prizes: Gr
 and Prize (5 winners) an Ocean Park ticket\; Appreciation Award a film cam
 era OR a HK$200 Starbucks voucher. Submission deadline 25 Sep. Details sha
 red via email.
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR